<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Magic Candle</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Conjurer (guild level 3), Sorcerer (guild level 7)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast magic candle</a>
</pre>
<p>Creates a bright magic candle out of your mana. Hold it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>) to 
light up dark places. It burns for about nine minutes: it dims after three, 
fades to a faint glow after six, and then flickers out and is gone.
</p><p>You must be standing, not fighting. The spell is also found on scrolls, 
staffs and wands. For a light that doesn't burn out, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sun Globe</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>